{"about_the_game":"You are an ordinary blacksmith in an extraordinary world. While heroes fight monsters, it\u2019s you who forges their weapons.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forge Simulator</h2>Forge swords, axes, spears, and even simple pitchforks for the locals.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084000/extras/a8b113c052f100eb9b92f8fc052e0c39.poster.avif?t=1759955027\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084000/extras/a8b113c052f100eb9b92f8fc052e0c39.webm?t=1759955027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084000/extras/a8b113c052f100eb9b92f8fc052e0c39.mp4?t=1759955027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapon Customization</h2>Every tempering, sharpening, gemstone, or rune gives the weapon unique properties.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084000/extras/8c9aa1e3d53ae339ef76962632c8977f.poster.avif?t=1759955027\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084000/extras/8c9aa1e3d53ae339ef76962632c8977f.webm?t=1759955027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084000/extras/8c9aa1e3d53ae339ef76962632c8977f.mp4?t=1759955027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quests and Orders</h2>Heroes, peasants, monster hunters, and even nobles\u2014you can take orders from anyone!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084000/extras/981daef593b8ed1b86167be0869b135e.poster.avif?t=1759955027\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084000/extras/981daef593b8ed1b86167be0869b135e.webm?t=1759955027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084000/extras/981daef593b8ed1b86167be0869b135e.mp4?t=1759955027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Choose combinations against monsters\u2019 weaknesses and equip heroes with what will help them survive\u2026 or not.<br></li><li>Trade with local merchants<br></li><li>Improve your reputation so wealthier clients will come to you<br></li><li>Upgrade your forge, unlock new machines and recipes</li></ul><br>The lives of heroes \u2014 and the entire kingdom \u2014 depend on your choices!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4084000?t=1759955027","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4084000?t=1759955027","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084000/b76b202b520067a41ce18649f92149e04677af02/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759955027","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084000/b76b202b520067a41ce18649f92149e04677af02/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759955027","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"You are an ordinary blacksmith in an extraordinary world. While heroes fight monsters, it\u2019s you who forges their weapons.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forge Simulator</h2>Forge swords, axes, spears, and even simple pitchforks for the locals.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084000/extras/a8b113c052f100eb9b92f8fc052e0c39.poster.avif?t=1759955027\" width=692