 help them survive\u2026 or not.<br></li><li>Trade with local merchants<br></li><li>Improve your reputation so wealthier clients will come to you<br></li><li>Upgrade your forge, unlock new machines and recipes</li></ul><br>The lives of heroes \u2014 and the entire kingdom \u2014 depend on your choices!","developers":["Tovarishch Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3916470","name":"Dungeon Forge"},"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084000/a958e133333943476158fa69ffef490533074b09/header.jpg?t=1759955027","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Dungeon Forge Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":[],"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Tovarishch Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"8 Oct, 2025"},"required_age":0,"short_description":"You are a blacksmith, not a hero. Create weapons with countless unique combinations, exploit monsters\u2019 weaknesses, and supply heroes with what will determine their fate.","steam_appid":4084000,"support_info":{"email":"tovarishch.games@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish, Japanese","type":"demo","website":null}